   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_7b4888049459f04adf3d",
   "sourceHash": "7b4888049459f04adf3d6023c45e8ac8fc80e7ce8dfc643179da25a2c3b05443",
   "text": "성",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_419a40d6bc312c31f379",
   "sourceHash": "419a40d6bc312c31f3794c88d1e73133f2fd5440901c4c960672c9debeeb82e6",
   "text": "어떤 도움이 필요하십니까?",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_e832be2e53273d5f271b",
   "sourceHash": "e832be2e53273d5f271b03343887480e988bd791a24d4127f7f5ccc37e674e8d",
   "text": "Kairali Ayurvedic Healing Village의 케랄라 판차카르마 치료",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_a19c5d326d8fa927285d",
   "sourceHash": "a19c5d326d8fa927285d7ab094b5fd7dfb4d81a70756813e9ffc509a83353ff4",
   "text": "케랄라 Kairali에서 정통 판차카르마 치료를 예약하십시오. 신뢰할 수 있는 해독 요법, 쾌적한 치료 체류, 요가, 아유르베다 의사 상담을 제공합니다.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "Banned term 'luxury wellness retreat' rendered as '쾌적한 치료 체류' (comfortable treatment stay) per clinical language lock."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_1cb2aabebb890c254391",
   "sourceHash": "1cb2aabebb890c2543915880395b1474a8f229d0e50a1e9542ed5be93eda02e9",
   "text": "Kairali — The Ayurvedic Healing Village, 팔라카드",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_554071111e0dac05e3b8",
   "sourceHash": "554071111e0dac05e3b865d44bc210fffb30d9826278aa5e1dd1b5cfab6b69a8",
   "text": "Kairali에서 요법 후 휴식을 취하는 환자",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
